  "provenance": {
    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout, text, and colors came from a clean, isolated plate texture the Forza Writer user supplied -- one of a set of thirteen originally extracted from GTA V's companion iFruit app (not this app's own game files, and not a screenshot taken in-game) and posted publicly to Reddit by u/sgtfrankieboy. A fictional sports-team novelty plate: 'LOS SANTOS' in small black caps above 'SHRIMPS' in a large red arched/curved script styled like a sports jersey wordmark -- the arched curve itself isn't reproducible (no curved-baseline text layout in this schema), so both lines render as plain straight placeholder rows. Red color (#DD3528) sampled directly. A solid red band runs along the bottom edge. Two empty corner sticker boxes, same treatment as the Liberty City templates above.",
